 "kind": "answer",
 "message": "Sorry about the chair! \ud83d\ude05 Unfortunately, it doesn't look like contractors get the home-office stipend. Our Laptops and equipment policy (POL-EQP-01) says full-time employees can claim a one-time stipend of up to $300 through expenses. Your record lists you as a contractor, and the policy doesn't offer the stipend to contractors. If you think your situation is different, talk to your manager or HR.",
 "cited_policy_ids": [
  "POL-EQP-01"
 ]
}
